{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "e82054c1a79b080c37db493aa53947a9dbfc31c47e4ebf49628acf14b00b8f90", "ja": "バトルは続く……", "zh": "战斗仍将继续……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6d4eda9a55cdf72e4d843dceb2fa186f58432301b7cdd980c234ee9134b3f810", "ja": "4人が出演したドラマは大好評で、公演も\n満員御礼。プロデューサーが打ち上げの希望\nを聞きに行くとメンバーはゲームで杏奈に\n挑戦している真っ最中。白熱するが、全員\n「クレープを食べに行きたい」と答える。", "zh": "4人出演的电视剧大受好评，演出也\n座无虚席。制作人前去询问庆功宴的意愿时，\n成员们正忙着在游戏中向杏奈发起挑战。\n战况虽白热化，但全员都回答说\n“想去吃可丽饼”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6988f7431d1a88fb2ae4d576a9124373a4151b2eaac1cb6009f19ad6043e21a8", "ja": "（杏奈達のドラマは話題性もあってか、大好評！\n公演も満員御礼で、最高の滑り出しになった！）", "zh": "（杏奈她们出演的电视剧或许是因为话题性十足，大受好评！\n公演也座无虚席，开局非常顺利！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1001_se", "source_sha256": "f4c1729e49f4e1a06f0a6fc22571b3da4047392af6f494dc2a81b817691601b8", "ja": "カチャカチャカチャ……カチャカチャ！", "zh": "咔哒咔哒咔哒……咔哒咔哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "14d8435d8e64814e05e5f9ab23c18c572dc9844167b0eda66f8435fffd4e7c8d", "ja": "ぐぬぬーっ！　もっちー、今のハメ技じゃないの！？\nなんかドコドコドコドコッて一瞬でやられたよ！", "zh": "呜呜呜——！小望，你刚才那招不是赖皮吗！？\n感觉被咚咚咚咚地一瞬间打倒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "bb13aa1edd18519f89d186a25296bfca5f59e71060dd92c708440e318e0fd11a", "ja": "……？　……そんなこと、ない……よ……？\n戦略、です……。", "zh": "……？　……才没有，那回事……呢……？\n这是战术……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d4dc9a25d893e3041373b5b80d00280fa4fe7464575e3f7fd360a778d96e161", "ja": "亜美、そろそろ交代してよ～。\n私も杏奈と戦いたーい。", "zh": "亚美，差不多该换我了吧～  \n我也想和杏奈对战——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "118db5aac42db0b771537169f866773bc84e782d3e4581f517bdb6d29cc82c34", "ja": "みらいっち、さっきずっとやってたじゃん！\n亜美が勝てるまで待ってよ～。", "zh": "未来亲，你刚才不是一直在玩吗！\n等到亚美赢了再说嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e9f4047df2bde32df05fd6aef6c91dc7353a6ba9d2418b9ec24b1a42301ad52b", "ja": "おーい、みんな……っと、ゲーム中か。", "zh": "喂——大家……啊，原来在玩游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "0bec6668a688c1f954fb3feaf31ec613f350021475f434165dbaff89ba88e3f0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　そうなんです、\nみんなで杏奈ちゃんに挑戦中なんですよ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！是这样的，\n大家正在一起挑战杏奈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "4c0e45fbc6c5b491eeee7ad955746e9eeabb9cf50cc769b7291d133ddd636f54", "ja": "あーっ！？　兄ちゃんが話しかけるからミスった！\n亜美が負けたら、兄ちゃんのせいだーっ！", "zh": "啊——！？都是因为哥哥跟我说话，我才失误的！亚美要是输了，就是哥哥的错——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4e16682023916de990aebe4114bd1bb5fc617b6b5e61e557dfb6e1b853567112", "ja": "集中力が足りないんじゃないか？\n人のせいにしてるようじゃ上手くなれないぞ！", "zh": "是不是注意力不够集中？总是怪罪别人，可是不会进步的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "cd6eae8813fc755394387e717ef00c378b4f9ed01d1e8a2101bdb4fcbeceab15", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、杏奈に\nチャレンジしに来たんですか？　私の次ですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是来向杏奈\n发起挑战的吗？得排在我后面哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7dc88e7ba451364b22a133efc31b0e0c63f7e461bba420b6cf5af84203df36e2", "ja": "いや、違うんだ。公演も無事終わったし、\n打ち上げをしようと思って……。", "zh": "不，不是的。演出也顺利结束了，\n我想着办个庆功宴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3515d7df64a82e2420115bc002e99e046305a9907eea8df25e56a8083e9b456d", "ja": "みんなの希望を聞きに来たんだ。\n何かあるか？　食べたいものとか。", "zh": "我是来听听大家的想法的。\n有什么想吃的之类吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "8fab23e768ebd3c01a9b100f77a49f5bc3ef6e3c3bf19290b66f79d1d8309abc", "ja": "食べたいもの……あっ！\nだったら私、食べたいものがあります♪", "zh": "想吃的东西……啊！\n这么说来，我有想吃的东西♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "2e012184575ae78c20f11b9ec418ef3e2947ad2b8afed9e8895066de77765b9d", "ja": "亜美が考えるに……みらいっちのそれは、\n生クリームがたっぷりの……アレだね？", "zh": "亚美觉得……未来想吃的那个，是鲜奶油满满的……那个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "408b4d17a0a2ab6ec7536f592f59da07e0298d85a1e332534ede1bd7ffe1fee7", "ja": "あっ……そっか！　クレープ！", "zh": "啊……对了！可丽饼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "1524a35f10de7d6c9658caf2a0b6b25e2a2ba9fe8e1d750733a0db6cbf0f8c70", "ja": "うん……いい、かも……。\nみんなで、行きたい……な……♪", "zh": "嗯……感觉，不错……\n要是能大家一起、去就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c88839433e16a9c59ba5a439ce917302737b9bfa24b22df6f80b7fc5cec676d1", "ja": "なるほど、クレープか。わかった。\nじゃあ、美味しそうなお店を探しておくよ。", "zh": "原来如此，是可丽饼啊。知道了。\n那我先找找看有没有看起来很好吃的店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "34dfaa44e1e28def3d57c02953e731a02a4fa3acd97ef6bf3a8a7a9c4c88c329", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとう……。\nなんだか、まだ……お芝居が続いてるみたい……です。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢……总觉得，好像戏剧还在继续……呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "86029dd44924d344fafebb51046212eef02cc37026503fb4d90300ea4df7465d", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね！　私も、なんだかもう一度、\n杏奈ちゃんやみんなと出会ったみたいな気分なんだ♪", "zh": "呵呵，是啊！我也总觉得，仿佛又一次和杏奈还有大家相遇了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "77427d4dd186064f3b9ce5b7906e02f8f9d744f05881d79b247eebfbb2281800", "ja": "（舞台でぶつかり合った4人が、今は屈託ない\n笑顔を見せている。だが、戦いはまだ続く……）", "zh": "（在舞台上彼此碰撞过的4个人，如今正露出毫无芥蒂的笑容。不过，战斗还在继续……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7a23ab6e5bc458d1a3ba59915da4e55f9a73e1116baee5dacbcd986f49f7136a", "ja": "（スイーツを食べて、英気を養って……\nまた、最高の戦いを見せてもらいたいな！）", "zh": "吃点甜食养精蓄锐……我还想再看看你们最精彩的对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
